ackground:#2a2a2a;color:#ffffff;border-radius:10px;padding:10px 16px;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;white-space:nowrap;\">Cancel</span><span style=\"background:#ffffff;color:#000000;border-radius:10px;padding:10px 16px;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;white-space:nowrap;\">Create and send invite</span></div></section></div></div>"
